    <node id="&quot;KENNETH C. GRIFFIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kenneth C. Griffin is a significant financial contributor to Daley's campaign and a major backer of the failed 2018 reelection campaign of Bruce Rauner."</data>
